OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers plant rainforest on
OL,4,ALakeland mountain
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have begun planting the
OL,7,Ffirst of hundreds of thousands of trees
OL,8,Fas part of a temperate rainforest on
OL,9,Fthe slopes of one of England's highest
OL,10,Fmountains.
OL,12,FCumbria Wildlife Trust said it hoped to
OL,13,Fplant 600,000 in the next 10 years on
OL,14,Fits new 3,000-acre nature reserve known
OL,15,Fas Skiddaw Forest, which it said was
OL,16,Fthe highest in England.
OL,18,FVolunteers are due to put in about
OL,19,F20,000 trees this winter and partner
OL,20,Forganisations will add another 20,000,
OL,21,Faccording to the trust.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
