OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers plant rainforest on
OL,4,ALakeland mountain
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteer Lisa Roberts, from Kendal,
OL,7,Fdescribed it as a "brilliant, positive"
OL,8,Fthing to do, as a contrast from the
OL,9,Fsense of pessimism she gets from some
OL,10,Fnews headlines.
